      "updated": 1795616849954,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "connection is provider-level\nsubscription is symbol-level.\n\n{\n    trade/lastPrice - the price of the most recent executed trade,\n    Quote - best bid, best ask, and often sizes,\n    Bar/Candle - Aggregated OHCV data, commonly per minute,\n    Level 2/depth - order-book levels beyond best bid/ask\n    Corporate actions/status - splits, dividends, halts, symbol changes\n}\n\nAlpaca; Polygon/Massive; Finnhub",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "connection is provider-level\nsubscription is symbol-level.\n\n{\n    trade/lastPrice - the price of the most recent executed trade,\n    Quote - best bid, best ask, and often sizes,\n    Bar/Candle - Aggregated OHCV data, commonly per minute,\n    Level 2/depth - order-book levels beyond best bid/ask\n    Corporate actions/status - splits, dividends, halts, symbol changes\n}\n\nAlpaca; Polygon/Massive; Finnhub",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
